  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\"><strong>637 個全新音效</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f60\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>這個資源包以我所喜愛的寫實簡約風格，重新打造了 Minecraft 的音效。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\">支援 1.10 至 26.X.X 版本（最新版本）</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>想要環境音效嗎？</strong></span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enhanced-audio-ambience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">[點擊此處] Enhanced Audio: Ambience</span></span></a></span></p><hr><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gAl1DKvs5-M\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>上面顯示 <span style=\"color:#f00\">不相容</span> 嗎？</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><br></span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5yK29l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"403\" height=\"107\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>別擔心，<span style=\"color:#0f0\">它仍然可以正常運作<span style=\"color:#000\">。</span></span></strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\">相容性</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我已在舊版本的 Minecraft 中測試過這個資源包，它支援從 1.10 到最新版本的所有版本。它甚至可能支援更舊的版本，但可能會有明顯的不一致之處。</span></p>",
